# INVWINWG.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, run with
# /CFG:COLDRAG.CFG (TEST/WIN/COLDRAG.CFG) and BIN/INVWIN.HLP beside the
# program (INVWIN_WINDATAWG): F1 during a drag, in Windows Help, whose
# window comes up over the frame without disabling it.  The item list's
# Category divider held 30 pixels right as F1 is pressed: the list no
# longer holds the mouse under Windows Help, and its release once ALT-F4
# has closed that leaves the column as it was.  The same for the
# splitter of the locations, held 40 pixels right.  The end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINWG.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
M 208 DOWN DIV 1
M 208 MOVE DIV 1 30 0
S DIVHELD
K F1
S DIVHELP
K ALT-F4
M 208 UP DIV 1 30 0
S DIVUP
K ALT-L B
M 220 DOWN MID
M 220 MOVE MID 40 0
S SPLHELD
K F1
S SPLHELP
K ALT-F4
M 220 UP MID 40 0
S SPLUP
K ALT-F X
